@k.words.promotion.noun.1 k.words.sense word=promotion pos=noun n=1 gloss="a message issued in behalf of some product or cause or idea or person or institution" synonym=promo synonym=publicity synonym="promotional material" synonym=packaging is_a=message part_of=marketing core.source="wordnet 3.1"
